<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends a tad easier, giving up gains.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends a tad easier, giving up gains.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sept 19 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (H)     99.16		   99.17</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key March Euroyen contract on TIFFE ended a tad easier on Thursday, giving up all its early gains as it was depressed to see long-term bonds fail to extend their gains in the morning, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;We've been watching JGBs (Japanese government bonds) throughout the day and March followed the benchmark 10-year bond which gave up all early gains by late trading,&quot; a city bank trader said.</p>
</text>
